; ZX Spectrum 48K BASIC ROM labels for the Xpeccy+ debugger.
;
; Names and data ranges from "The Complete Spectrum ROM Disassembly" by Richard
; Dymond (https://github.com/skoolkid/rom, sources/rom.skool, commit efb80489,
; 2026-11-06), (c) 2026 Richard Dymond; its routine names follow the book of that
; name by Dr Ian Logan and Dr Frank O'Hara (Melbourne House, 1983). Used under the
; Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License
; (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/), by his e-mail of 2026-11-10.
; Not covered by the MIT license of Xpeccy+.
;
; Changed for Xpeccy+ on 2026-11-10: val renamed val_fn (VAL is a pseudo-variable
; of the debugger's expressions); data ranges from his DEFB (db), DEFS (db), DEFM
; (text) and DEFW (da) lines; the system variables left out (sysvars-basic48.labels
; has them).
;
; @rom <MD5 of a 16K bank> <bundled image> [-NAME / -@ADDR: not in that bank]
; ADDR NAME: a name; START END VIEW: a data range
@ns BASIC48
@rom 4c42a2f075212361c3117015b107ff68 48.rom, alf.rom bank 1, zxevo-fe.rom bank 7
@rom 6e09e5d3c4aef166601669feaaadc01c 128-1.rom, 128p-1.rom, phoenix.rom bank 3, profi-bios20.rom bank 3, profi-kramis02.rom bank 3, tsconf.rom bank 3 -KEY_INT -PO_T_UDG -P_SAVE -P_INK -P_PAPER -P_FLASH -STMT_R_1 -STMT_NEXT -LAST -CHARSET -@386E
